window.LEARN_CONTENT=window.LEARN_CONTENT||{};window.LEARN_CONTENT["a-0169dfa5d4e3e205"]={"zh":"<h1 id=\"codex-micro\">Codex Micro</h1> <blockquote> <p>完整文档索引请参阅 <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt（需联网）</a>。在文档 URL 末尾添加 <code>.md</code> 可获取对应 Markdown 版本。</p> </blockquote> <p>Codex Micro 是 Codex 与 Work Louder 的限时合作产品。它与 ChatGPT 桌面应用配合，让你不用离开键盘就能快速查看聊天、切换聊天、使用语音输入，以及触发常见操作或技能。</p> <blockquote> <p>插图：带发光 Agent 键、可自定义 Command 键、旋钮和摇杆的交互式 Codex Micro 键盘</p> </blockquote> <p><a id=\"set-up-codex-micro\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"codex-micro_1\">设置 Codex Micro</h2> <ol> <li>打开 ChatGPT 桌面应用。</li> <li>按一次背面的按钮，打开 Codex Micro。</li> <li>使用 USB-C 连接，或<a href=\"#/article/a-0169dfa5d4e3e205?anchor=pair-with-bluetooth\">配对 Bluetooth</a>，然后按照 ChatGPT 检测到设备时出现的设置提示操作。</li> <li>在 macOS 上，出现提示时允许 <strong>输入监控</strong>，这样 ChatGPT 才能响应按键。</li> <li>打开 <strong>设置 &gt; Codex Micro</strong>，选择 Agent 键跟随或触发的内容，自定义 Command 键、摇杆和旋钮，并调整灯光和语音控制。</li> </ol> <p>默认情况下，短暂按住旋钮会打开这些设置；也可以在 ChatGPT 底部、账户名称旁选择 Micro 图标。自定义旋钮分配后，可以替代按住旋钮的快捷方式。</p> <p>ChatGPT 第一次检测到受支持的 Micro 后，设备设置仍然可用。ChatGPT 集成不要求安装 Work Louder Input；该工具可用于为其他应用自定义控制或配置更多层。</p> <p><a id=\"pair-with-bluetooth\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"bluetooth\">通过 Bluetooth 配对</h2> <p>Codex Micro 提供三个 Bluetooth 通道。</p> <ol> <li>按一次背面按钮打开 Micro。</li> <li>按住左下边缘的触控区域三秒。Micro 下方灯光变蓝表示 Bluetooth 模式已开启。</li> <li>点击触控区域选择通道 1、2 或 3。通道灯快速闪烁表示设备已准备好配对。</li> <li>打开电脑的 Bluetooth 设置，在设备出现时连接 Micro。</li> <li>等待通道灯变为常亮，表示配对完成。</li> </ol> <p>五秒内没有输入时，连接选择器会关闭。要切换到另一个已配对通道，再次打开选择器，选择通道并等待关闭。要重新配对该通道，按住触控区域三秒，直到指示灯开始闪烁。</p> <p>如果要使用 USB-C，打开连接选择器并点击触控区域，直到 Micro 下方灯光变白。Micro 仍处于 Bluetooth 模式时插入 USB-C 线只会充电，不会切换到有线连接。</p> <p>硬件图示请参阅 <a href=\"https://worklouder.cc/openai-micro-setup\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Work Louder Codex Micro 设置指南（需联网）</a>。</p> <p><a id=\"read-and-switch-tasks-with-agent-keys\"></a></p> <p><a id=\"read-and-switch-chats-with-agent-keys\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"agent\">用 Agent 键阅读和切换聊天</h2> <p>六个磨砂 Agent 键可以各自跟随一个聊天，并用灯光显示当前状态。按一次 Agent 键可切换到该聊天，但不会把 ChatGPT 带到前台；在 350 毫秒内按两次会切换聊天并把 ChatGPT 窗口带到前台。要单击一次就聚焦 ChatGPT，请在设备设置中开启 <strong>单击聚焦 ChatGPT</strong>。</p> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>灯光</th> <th>状态</th> <th>含义</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td>白色</td> <td>空闲</td> <td>聊天处于空闲状态。</td> </tr> <tr> <td>蓝色</td> <td>思考中</td> <td>ChatGPT 正在工作。</td> </tr> <tr> <td>绿色</td> <td>完成</td> <td>聊天完成，并有未读更新。</td> </tr> <tr> <td>琥珀色</td> <td>需要输入</td> <td>ChatGPT 需要你的批准或回复。</td> </tr> <tr> <td>红色</td> <td>错误</td> <td>发生了问题。</td> </tr> <tr> <td>熄灭</td> <td>未分配聊天</td> <td>该键没有跟随聊天。</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p>当前选中聊天对应的键会以该状态灯光脉动。</p> <p>开箱即用时，按最近更新时间让六个键跟随最近的六个聊天，无论聊天是否置顶。可在设备设置的 <strong>Agent keys</strong> 中更改排列方式：</p> <ul> <li><strong>最近聊天</strong>：跟随最近更新的六个聊天，置顶和未置顶都包括；</li> <li><strong>置顶聊天</strong>：跟随 <strong>置顶</strong> 中的前六个聊天；</li> <li><strong>优先聊天</strong>：把等待输入、未读和活动聊天排在前面；</li> <li><strong>自定义分配</strong>：为每个 Agent 键分配聊天、快捷键、实体按键动作或已启用技能。按未分配的 Agent 键会打开新聊天，开始聊天后 ChatGPT 会把它分配给该键。</li> </ul> <p>跟随聊天时状态颜色不变；使用 <strong>自定义分配</strong> 时，Agent 键也可以直接触发动作。</p> <p><a id=\"use-and-customize-command-keys\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"command\">使用和自定义 Command 键</h2> <p>Codex Micro 的默认布局包含六个动作：</p> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>按键</th> <th>默认动作</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td><code>Fast</code>（快速模式）</td> <td>打开或关闭快速模式。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>Approve</code>（批准）</td> <td>批准当前请求。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>Decline</code>（拒绝）</td> <td>拒绝当前请求。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>Fork</code>（分叉对话）</td> <td>在新聊天中继续当前聊天。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>Mic</code>（麦克风）</td> <td>开始按住说话。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>Codex</code>（发送）</td> <td>发送输入框中的消息。</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p>Mic 键使用电脑的麦克风，Codex Micro 本身没有麦克风。默认使用 <strong>按住说话</strong>：说话时按住，结束时松开。350 毫秒内按两次可以保持录音，再按一次停止。</p> <p>录音时，青绿色灯光会绕键盘移动；ChatGPT 处理语音时变成移动的白光，提示词准备好后变为常亮白色。按 Codex 键发送。</p> <p>如果 <strong>麦克风键</strong> 中提供了 <strong>语音聊天</strong>，可以用 Mic 键开始语音聊天或切换麦克风；按住它可以结束聊天。开启 <strong>使用独立麦克风键</strong> 后，可以分别映射宽 Mic 键下的两个开关。</p> <p>在设备设置中，从 <strong>布局</strong> 预览选择 Command 键，再选择它的键帽和动作。可以打开浏览器或终端、管理聊天、审阅修改、运行 Git 和拉取请求操作、附加文件或照片、打开插件或计划任务、调整推理强度、运行已启用技能，或分配其他快捷键。如果选择了已经在其他位置使用的键帽，ChatGPT 会交换两个键，而不是重复使用同一个键帽。</p> <p>重新映射按键后，把实体键帽换成对应动作。选择 <strong>重置布局</strong> 会恢复默认 Command 键和摇杆分配，但不会改变 Agent 键模式或自定义聊天分配。</p> <p><a id=\"use-the-analog-stick-and-dial\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_1\">使用摇杆和旋钮</h2> <p>摇杆可以向任意方向移动。当推离中心达到一定程度时，ChatGPT 会把动作转换为四个方向动作之一。Codex Micro 的初始映射如下：</p> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>方向</th> <th>默认动作</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td>上</td> <td>打开或关闭计划模式。</td> </tr> <tr> <td>右</td> <td>在应用历史中前进。</td> </tr> <tr> <td>下</td> <td>显示或隐藏侧边栏。</td> </tr> <tr> <td>左</td> <td>在应用历史中后退。</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p>在设备设置中，可以为每个方向选择可用的 ChatGPT 桌面命令或已启用技能。</p> <p>旋钮默认使用 <strong>输入框导航</strong>：旋转浏览输入框控件和选项，按下打开或选择当前控件。当输入框控件或菜单打开时，旋钮右侧的 Agent 键会立即亮红；按该键可取消。</p> <p>设备设置提供四种旋钮模式：</p> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>模式</th> <th>行为</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td><strong>输入框导航</strong></td> <td>浏览输入框控件并选择当前控件。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><strong>仅推理</strong></td> <td>调整推理强度并打开滑块或高级选项。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><strong>对话滚动</strong></td> <td>滚动当前聊天；按旋钮跳转到最新消息。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><strong>自定义分配</strong></td> <td>为左转、右转、按下和长按分别分配动作或技能。</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p>除 <strong>自定义分配</strong> 外，在所有模式下按住旋钮都会打开设备设置；在自定义模式下则运行长按分配的动作。</p> <p><a id=\"adjust-lighting\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_2\">调整灯光</h2> <p>在设备设置中调整 <strong>亮度</strong>，并选择 30 秒到一小时的 <strong>自动变暗</strong> 间隔，或关闭自动变暗。使用 Micro，或 Agent 键状态变化时，灯光会重新亮起。默认三分钟后熄灭。</p> <p>当 Micro 报告电池状态时，设备设置和侧边栏的 Micro 图标旁都会显示电量。</p> <p><a id=\"add-more-layers\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_3\">添加更多层</h2> <p>ChatGPT 使用第 1 层。使用 <a href=\"https://worklouder.cc/micro-setup\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Work Louder Input（需联网）</a> 可以为其他应用配置最多五个额外层，每层都可设置快捷键和动作。</p> <p><a id=\"troubleshoot-codex-micro\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"codex-micro_2\">排查 Codex Micro 问题</h2> <p><a id=\"fix-input-monitoring-on-macos\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"macos\">修复 macOS 输入监控</h3> <p>如果设备设置显示尚未配置输入监控，请选择 <strong>打开系统设置</strong>，然后：</p> <ol> <li>打开 <strong>系统设置 &gt; 隐私与安全性 &gt; 输入监控</strong>；</li> <li>如果列表中已有 ChatGPT，打开其权限；如果没有，把“应用程序”中的 <strong>ChatGPT</strong> 拖入列表，或选择 <strong>添加 (+)</strong> 后选中它；</li> <li>退出并重新打开 ChatGPT，确认它在第 1 层检测到 Micro。</li> </ol> <p>更多 macOS 权限信息请参阅 <a href=\"https://support.apple.com/guide/mac-help/mchl4cedafb6/mac\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Apple 输入监控指南（需联网）</a>。</p> <p><a id=\"fix-connection-interference\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"_4\">排查连接干扰</h3> <p>ChatGPT 检测到 Micro 但无法连接，或通信中断时，会自动重试。如果问题继续，重新连接 Micro，并检查键盘工具或安全工具是否阻止访问。</p> <p>在 macOS 上，Work Louder 指出，当 Karabiner 或 Logitech Options+ 获得输入监控权限时，可能干扰 Micro 通信。可退出这些键盘工具，或临时关闭它们的输入监控权限，再重新连接 Micro。如果电脑由组织管理，请让 IT 管理员检查设备规则。</p> <p><a id=\"get-more-work-louder-help\"></a></p> <h3 id=\"work-louder\">获取 Work Louder 帮助</h3> <p>Bluetooth、线缆、电源或键盘重置问题请参阅 <a href=\"https://worklouder.cc/openai-micro-setup\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Work Louder Codex Micro 设置指南（需联网）</a>。也可以发送邮件至 hello@worklouder.cc（已阻止不安全链接） 获取直接支持。</p> <p><a id=\"get-a-compatible-micro\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"micro\">获取兼容的 Micro</h2> <p>通过 <a href=\"https://openai.com/supply/co-lab/work-louder/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">OpenAI Supply Co（需联网）</a> 查看 Codex Micro 的供应情况。ChatGPT 桌面应用也支持 <a href=\"https://worklouder.cc/creator-micro-2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Creator Micro 2（需联网）</a>，可直接从 Work Louder 购买。</p>","en":"<h1 id=\"codex-micro\">Codex Micro</h1> <blockquote> <p>For the complete documentation index, see <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt (online)</a>. Markdown versions of documentation pages are available by appending <code>.md</code> to the page URL.</p> </blockquote> <p>Codex Micro is a limited-run collaboration between Codex and Work Louder. It works with the ChatGPT desktop app, giving you a quick way to check on chats, jump between them, use voice input, and trigger common actions or skills without leaving the keyboard.</p> <blockquote> <p>Illustration: Interactive Codex Micro keyboard with illuminated Agent Keys, customizable Command Keys, a dial, and an analog stick</p> </blockquote> <h2 id=\"set-up-codex-micro\">Set up Codex Micro</h2> <ol> <li>Open the ChatGPT desktop app.</li> <li>Press the rear button once to turn on Codex Micro.</li> <li>Connect it with a USB-C cable or <a href=\"#/article/a-0169dfa5d4e3e205?anchor=pair-with-bluetooth\">pair it with Bluetooth</a>, then follow the setup that appears when ChatGPT detects it.</li> <li>On macOS, allow <strong>Input Monitoring</strong> when prompted so ChatGPT can respond to key presses.</li> <li>Open <strong>Settings &gt; Codex Micro</strong> to choose what the Agent Keys follow or trigger, customize the Command Keys, analog stick, and dial, and adjust lighting and voice controls.</li> </ol> <p>By default, press and hold the dial for a short while to open these settings. You can also select the Micro icon beside your account name at the bottom of ChatGPT. A custom dial assignment can replace the press-and-hold shortcut.</p> <p>The device settings remain available after ChatGPT detects a supported Micro for the first time. Work Louder Input isn't required for the ChatGPT integration. Use it to customize controls for other apps or configure more layers.</p> <h2 id=\"pair-with-bluetooth\">Pair with Bluetooth</h2> <p>Codex Micro provides three Bluetooth channels.</p> <ol> <li>Press the rear button once to turn on the Micro.</li> <li>Press and hold the touch control on the bottom-left edge for three seconds. The lighting under the Micro turns blue when Bluetooth mode is active.</li> <li>Tap the touch control to choose Bluetooth channel 1, 2, or 3. A fast-flashing channel light means the Micro is ready to pair.</li> <li>Open your computer's Bluetooth settings and connect to the Micro when it appears.</li> <li>Wait for the channel light to turn solid, which means pairing is complete.</li> </ol> <p>The connection selector closes after five seconds without input. To switch to another paired channel, open the selector again, choose the channel, and wait for it to close. To pair that channel again, press and hold the touch control for three seconds until its light begins flashing.</p> <p>To use USB-C instead, open the connection selector and tap the touch control until the lighting under the Micro turns white. Connecting a USB-C cable while the Micro is still in Bluetooth mode charges it but doesn't switch it to the wired connection.</p> <p>For hardware diagrams, see the <a href=\"https://worklouder.cc/openai-micro-setup\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Work Louder Codex Micro setup guide (online)</a>.</p> <p><a id=\"read-and-switch-tasks-with-agent-keys\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"read-and-switch-chats-with-agent-keys\">Read and switch chats with Agent Keys</h2> <p>Each of the six frosted Agent Keys can follow a chat and light up to show its current status. Press an Agent Key once to switch to that chat without bringing ChatGPT forward. Press it twice within 350 milliseconds to switch chats and bring the ChatGPT window forward. To focus ChatGPT with the first press, turn on <strong>Focus ChatGPT with a single tap</strong> in the device settings.</p> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>Light</th> <th>Status</th> <th>Meaning</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td>White</td> <td>Idle</td> <td>The chat is idle.</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Blue</td> <td>Thinking</td> <td>ChatGPT is working.</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Green</td> <td>Complete</td> <td>The chat completed with an unread update.</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Amber</td> <td>Requires input</td> <td>ChatGPT needs your approval or response.</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Red</td> <td>Error</td> <td>Something went wrong.</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Off</td> <td>No assigned chat</td> <td>The key doesn't follow a chat.</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p>The selected chat's key pulses with its status light.</p> <p>Out of the box, the keys follow your six most recently updated chats, whether or not they're pinned. Change <strong>Agent keys</strong> in the device settings to use a different arrangement:</p> <ul> <li><strong>Most recent chats</strong>: Follow the six most recently updated chats, pinned or unpinned.</li> <li><strong>Pinned chats</strong>: Follow the first six chats in <strong>Pinned</strong>.</li> <li><strong>Priority chats</strong>: Put chats waiting for input, unread chats, and active chats first.</li> <li><strong>Custom assignments</strong>: Assign a chat, shortcut, physical key action, or enabled skill to each Agent Key. Press an unassigned Agent Key to open a new chat. When you start the chat, ChatGPT assigns it to that key.</li> </ul> <p>The status colors stay the same for keys that follow chats. With <strong>Custom assignments</strong>, an Agent Key can trigger an action instead.</p> <h2 id=\"use-and-customize-command-keys\">Use and customize Command Keys</h2> <p>Codex Micro comes with six actions in its default layout:</p> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>Key</th> <th>Default action</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td><code>Fast</code></td> <td>Turn Fast mode on or off.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>Approve</code></td> <td>Approve the current request.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>Decline</code></td> <td>Decline the current request.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>Fork</code></td> <td>Continue the current chat in a new chat.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>Mic</code></td> <td>Start push-to-talk.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>Codex</code></td> <td>Send the message in the composer.</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p>The Mic key uses your computer's microphone. Codex Micro doesn't have a microphone of its own. By default, it uses <strong>Push to talk</strong>: hold the key while you speak, then release it to stop. For hands-free recording, press it twice within 350 milliseconds to keep recording. Press it again to stop.</p> <p>A sea-green light moves around the keyboard while you record. It changes to a moving white light while ChatGPT processes your speech, then turns solid white when the prompt is ready. Press the Codex key to send it.</p> <p>If <strong>Voice Chat</strong> is available under <strong>Microphone key</strong>, choose it to use the Mic key to start a Voice Chat or toggle your microphone; press and hold it to end the chat. Turn on <strong>Use separate microphone keys</strong> to map the two switches under the wide Mic key independently.</p> <p>In the device settings, select a Command Key in the <strong>Layout</strong> preview, then choose its keycap and action. You can open the browser or terminal, manage chats, review changes, run Git and pull request actions, attach files or photos, open plugins or scheduled tasks, change reasoning effort, run an enabled skill, or assign another shortcut. If you choose a keycap that's already used somewhere else, ChatGPT swaps the two instead of using one keycap twice.</p> <p>After you remap a key, swap the physical keycap to match its new action. Select <strong>Reset layout</strong> to restore the default Command Key and analog stick assignments without changing the Agent Key mode or custom chat assignments.</p> <h2 id=\"use-the-analog-stick-and-dial\">Use the analog stick and dial</h2> <p>The analog stick moves freely in any direction. When you push it far enough from the center, ChatGPT turns the movement into one of four directional actions. Codex Micro starts with the mappings shown here.</p> <p>Choose any available ChatGPT desktop command or enabled skill for each direction in the device settings.</p> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>Direction</th> <th>Default action</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td>Up</td> <td>Turn Plan mode on or off.</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Right</td> <td>Go forward in app history.</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Down</td> <td>Show or hide the sidebar.</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Left</td> <td>Go back in app history.</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p>The dial uses <strong>Composer navigation</strong> by default. Turn it to move through composer controls and options, then press it to open or select the focused control. When a composer control or menu is open, the Agent Key immediately to the right of the dial lights red. Press that key to cancel.</p> <p>Choose one of four dial modes in the device settings:</p> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>Mode</th> <th>Behavior</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td><strong>Composer navigation</strong></td> <td>Move through composer controls and select the focused control.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><strong>Reasoning only</strong></td> <td>Adjust reasoning effort and open its slider or advanced options.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><strong>Conversation scrolling</strong></td> <td>Scroll the active chat; press the dial to jump to the latest message.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><strong>Custom assignments</strong></td> <td>Assign an action or skill to the left turn, right turn, press, and long press.</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p>Pressing and holding the dial opens the device settings in every mode except <strong>Custom assignments</strong>, where it runs the action assigned to the long press.</p> <h2 id=\"adjust-lighting\">Adjust lighting</h2> <p>In the device settings, adjust <strong>Brightness</strong> and choose an <strong>Auto-dim</strong> interval from 30 seconds to one hour, or turn automatic dimming off. The lights come back on when you use the Micro or an Agent Key changes status. By default, the lights turn off after three minutes.</p> <p>When the Micro reports its battery status, you can see it in the device settings and beside the Micro icon in the sidebar.</p> <h2 id=\"add-more-layers\">Add more layers</h2> <p>ChatGPT uses layer 1. Use <a href=\"https://worklouder.cc/micro-setup\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Work Louder Input (online)</a> to configure up to five more layers with shortcuts and actions for other apps.</p> <h2 id=\"troubleshoot-codex-micro\">Troubleshoot Codex Micro</h2> <h3 id=\"fix-input-monitoring-on-macos\">Fix Input Monitoring on macOS</h3> <p>If the device settings show that Input Monitoring isn't set up, select <strong>Open System Settings</strong>, then follow these steps:</p> <ol> <li>Open <strong>System Settings &gt; Privacy &amp; Security &gt; Input Monitoring</strong>.</li> <li>Turn on access for ChatGPT if it's already listed. If it's missing, drag <strong>ChatGPT</strong> from Applications into the list, or select <strong>Add (+)</strong> and choose <strong>ChatGPT</strong>.</li> <li>Quit and reopen ChatGPT, then confirm it detects the Micro on layer 1.</li> </ol> <p>For more about this macOS permission, see <a href=\"https://support.apple.com/guide/mac-help/mchl4cedafb6/mac\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Apple's Input Monitoring guide (online)</a>.</p> <h3 id=\"fix-connection-interference\">Fix connection interference</h3> <p>ChatGPT retries automatically when it detects a Micro but can't connect or loses communication. If the problem continues, reconnect the Micro and check whether a keyboard utility or security tool blocks access to it.</p> <p>On macOS, Work Louder notes that Karabiner and Logitech Options+ can interfere with Micro communication when those apps have Input Monitoring permission. To test for interference, quit the keyboard utility or temporarily turn off its Input Monitoring access, then reconnect the Micro. If your organization manages your computer, ask your IT administrator to check the device rules.</p> <h3 id=\"get-more-work-louder-help\">Get more Work Louder help</h3> <p>For help with Bluetooth, cables, power, or resetting the keyboard, see the <a href=\"https://worklouder.cc/openai-micro-setup\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Work Louder Codex Micro setup guide (online)</a>. For direct support, email hello@worklouder.cc (blocked unsafe link).</p> <h2 id=\"get-a-compatible-micro\">Get a compatible Micro</h2> <p>Check Codex Micro availability through <a href=\"https://openai.com/supply/co-lab/work-louder/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">OpenAI Supply Co (online)</a>. The ChatGPT desktop app also supports <a href=\"https://worklouder.cc/creator-micro-2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Creator Micro 2 (online)</a>, available directly from Work Louder.</p>"};
